/>
```

### 下拉选择
```html
<select 
  class="form-select"
  style="height: 36px; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;"
>
  <option value="">请选择...</option>
</select>
```

### 标签与输入框
```html
<div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
  <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500;">字段名称</label>
  <input type="text" class="form-input" />
</div>
```

